              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="font-semibold">Option 2: Cushion Stack</p>
                <p class="text-sm">Stack 2-4 firm cushions or folded blankets. Sit on the stack with knees on the floor. Gradually reduce height as flexibility improves.</p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="font-semibold">Option 3: Chair Seiza</p>
